WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.165 --> 00:00:11.275
 

00:00:12.985 --> 00:00:14.535
 

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:17.820
Aurora...

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.460
At that altitude you can touch it...

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.500
Every color...

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:29.180
Colors you've never seen before

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:30.340
 

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.020
Lights

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.980
Moving all around you

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:38.500
The Universe

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.620
And its right there...

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.100
I always think of Sagan's words

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:57.860
"Every human being

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.100
that ever was

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.180
lived out their lives

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.780
On a mound of dust

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:10.000
standing in a sunbeam”

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:16.820
Three...Two...One

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:28.300
Anytime people venture into the unknown...There is a cost.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:35.940
 

